+---
+"pacquet": patch
+---
+
+`--config.dedupe-direct-deps=<value>`, `--dedupe-direct-deps`, and `--no-dedupe-direct-deps` now override the `dedupeDirectDeps` setting for a single run. The `--config.` form used to be dropped without a message, so `pnpm install --config.dedupe-direct-deps=false` kept linking a direct dependency shared with the workspace root only at the root, and a later `pnpm pack` failed with `ERR_PNPM_CANNOT_RESOLVE_WORKSPACE_PROTOCOL`.
